1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,320
Yesterday Aunt Daisy was at the supermarket.
Hôm qua Dì Daisy ở siêu thị.

2
00:00:08,320 --> 00:00:12,560
Then she was at the bookshop.
Rồi dì ở hiệu sách.

3
00:00:12,560 --> 00:00:17,039
Then she was at the train station.
Rồi dì ở ga tàu.

4
00:00:17,039 --> 00:00:20,800
Then she was at the hospital.
Rồi dì ở bệnh viện.

5
00:00:20,800 --> 00:00:24,160
Then she was at the bank.
Rồi dì ở ngân hàng.

6
00:00:24,160 --> 00:00:28,960
And then she was at the park next to the bank.
Và rồi dì ở công viên cạnh ngân hàng.

7
00:00:29,600 --> 00:00:34,240
Which park was Aunt Daisy at?
Dì Daisy ở công viên nào?

8
00:00:34,240 --> 00:00:36,240
Two.
Hai.

9
00:00:36,240 --> 00:00:41,200
Yesterday Ella and Flo were with our grandparents.
Hôm qua Ella và Flo đi với ông bà.

10
00:00:41,200 --> 00:00:44,399
First they were at the bus stop.
Đầu tiên họ ở trạm xe buýt.

11
00:00:44,399 --> 00:00:47,280
Then they were at the zoo.
Rồi họ ở sở thú.

12
00:00:47,280 --> 00:00:50,880
After that they were at the library.
Sau đó họ ở thư viện.

13
00:00:50,880 --> 00:00:54,400
Next they were at the swimming pool.
Tiếp theo họ ở bể bơi.

14
00:00:54,400 --> 00:00:57,600
Then they were at the shopping centre.
Rồi họ ở trung tâm mua sắm.

15
00:00:57,600 --> 00:01:02,960
And after that they were at the park next to the shopping centre.
Và sau đó họ ở công viên cạnh trung tâm mua sắm.

16
00:01:02,960 --> 00:01:07,280
Which park were Ella and Flo at?
Ella và Flo ở công viên nào?

17
00:01:08,320 --> 00:01:10,719
Three.
Ba.

18
00:01:10,719 --> 00:01:14,159
Yesterday I was very busy.
Hôm qua mình rất bận.

19
00:01:14,159 --> 00:01:18,000
In the morning I was at the supermarket.
Buổi sáng mình ở siêu thị.

20
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:21,120
Then I was at the bookshop.
Rồi mình ở hiệu sách.

21
00:01:21,120 --> 00:01:25,680
In the afternoon I was at the cafe with my cousins.
Buổi chiều mình ở quán cà phê với các anh chị em họ.

22
00:01:25,680 --> 00:01:29,360
Then I was at the library looking for a book.
Rồi mình ở thư viện tìm sách.

23
00:01:29,360 --> 00:01:33,440
After that I was at the zoo with my friends.
Sau đó mình ở sở thú với bạn bè.

24
00:01:33,440 --> 00:01:36,400
Next to the zoo there's a park.
Cạnh sở thú có một công viên.

25
00:01:36,400 --> 00:01:40,080
And after the zoo we were in that park.
Và sau khi đi sở thú chúng mình ở công viên đó.

26
00:01:40,080 --> 00:01:43,600
Which park was I at?
Mình ở công viên nào?
